WEBVTT

00:39:29.134 --> 00:39:30.787
a decade later.

00:39:30.811 --> 00:39:33.783
They can easily imagine a world
in which they're unemployed,

00:39:33.807 --> 00:39:36.550
so they don't take it for granted
that they have jobs.

00:39:37.620 --> 00:39:41.546
Counterfactual thinking has come in handy
for Scott over the past month.

00:39:41.570 --> 00:39:44.126
As bad as the coronavirus situation is,

00:39:44.150 --> 00:39:46.996
he's been reflecting on
how things could be worse.

00:39:47.020 --> 00:39:53.971
SK: You know, if given the choice
of spending a year in my apartment

00:39:53.995 --> 00:39:56.036
or a year in space,

00:39:56.060 --> 00:39:59.303
the apartment wins hands-down every time.